                    <h1 class="card-title text-success">Payment successful!</h1>
                    <p class="card-text">Thank you for your order. Your payment has been processed successfully.</p>
                    <hr>
                    <p class="card-text">Our payment methods:</p>
                    <div class="payment-icons">
                        <i class="fab fa-cc-visa mr-3"></i>
                        <i class="fab fa-cc-mastercard mr-3"></i>
